{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftuitracking"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"SwiftUITracking","symbolKind":"module","title":"SwiftUITracking","modules":[{"name":"SwiftUITracking"}],"role":"collection"},"abstract":[{"text":"Give SwiftUI views a tracker through the environment, and track what they do with view modifiers.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenKey"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this module to track events from SwiftUI views on Apple platforms; elsewhere it builds empty.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Set a tracker once, at the root of the views, with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracker(_:)"},{"text":", and read it in any view below","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Environment(\\.tracker)"},{"text":". A button’s action can track through it, which a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"binding can’t reach, since SwiftUI runs actions on tasks of its own. Until a tracker is set, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"environment’s tracker tracks through the one ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tracker.bootstrap"},{"text":" made the process’s default, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with none it drops each event, warning once per call site. In a preview it is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tracker.noOp"},{"text":", so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a preview tracks nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The modifiers track through the environment’s tracker, once per trigger, and record the place","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they are applied as the call site. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackOnAppear(_:)"},{"text":" tracks each time a view appears,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackOnTap(_:)"},{"text":" each tap beside the view’s own action, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackChange(of:_:)"},{"text":" each new value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreen(_:)"},{"text":" tracks ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenViewed"},{"text":" each time the view appears, and puts a tracker enriched","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the screen’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenKey"},{"text":" in the environment inside it, so every event tracked from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"screen carries its name:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftUI","import Traffluent","","@Event","struct CartOpened {}","","@Event","struct CheckoutStarted {","    var cartSize: Int","}","","struct CartView: View {","    @Environment(\\.tracker) private var tracker","","    var body: some View {","        List {","            Button(\"Check out\") {","                tracker.track(CheckoutStarted(cartSize: 3))  \/\/ its record's context[ScreenKey.self] is \"Cart\"","            }","        }","        .trackOnAppear(CartOpened())","    }","}","","let tracker = Tracker()","let root = CartView()","    .trackScreen(\"Cart\")  \/\/ tracks ScreenViewed(screen: \"Cart\") each time it appears","    .tracker(tracker)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apply "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreen(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" where the screen’s view is placed, as above, not in the view’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":":"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a view’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Environment"},{"type":"text","text":" reads the environment around it, which its own body’s modifiers don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Where UIKit has traits, the environment’s tracker is the same value as UIKit’s trait","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/UIKitTracking\/documentation\/UIKitTracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), so SwiftUI views hosted in UIKit read the scene’s tracker. For UIKit and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"AppKit views, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/UIKitTracking\/documentation\/UIKitTracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/appkittracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To track screens without a modifier on each, see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/automaticscreentracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The guide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers all three frameworks.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"API","text":"API"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The documentation site is built on Linux, where this module’s views aren’t there, so their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"symbols have no pages of their own here. Their doc comments are in the sources, and Xcode shows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them for an Apple target. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" build on every platform, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking plan or a collector off Apple platforms can name them.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Setting-the-tracker","text":"Setting the tracker"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"EnvironmentValues.tracker","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.tracker(_:)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Tracking-from-views","text":"Tracking from views"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"View.trackOnAppear(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.trackOnTap(_:)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.trackChange(of:_:)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Screens","text":"Screens"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.trackScreen(_:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenKey"}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftUITracking/documentation/SwiftUITracking":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Give SwiftUI views a tracker through the environment, and track what they do with view modifiers."}],"title":"SwiftUITracking","url":"\/documentation\/swiftuitracking","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/trackingfromviews":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tracking from SwiftUI, UIKit and AppKit"}],"type":"link","title":"Tracking from SwiftUI, UIKit and AppKit","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews"},"doc://SwiftUITracking/documentation/SwiftUITracking/ScreenViewed":{"title":"ScreenViewed","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ScreenViewed","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Someone viewed the screen named "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed\/screen","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": what "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreen(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks each time its view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appears."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftuitracking\/screenviewed","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ScreenViewed","kind":"identifier"}]